{"nodes": [{"id": "readme", "label": "Arohance Next.js Port README", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_design_reference_bundles", "label": "Seven Root Arohance HTML Bundles (Design Reference)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The originals are the fidelity specification, must stay byte-identical, and correctness is \"renders indistinguishably\", checked by the harness rather than by eye."}, {"id": "readme_npm_test_glob", "label": "npm test Explicit Glob Script", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "node --test tools/ lib/ directory discovery fails on Node 22; only the explicit glob works, so it is wrapped in a script instead of left to memory."}, {"id": "readme_unbundle_prerequisite", "label": "Fresh-clone Unbundle Prerequisite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "unbundle.test.mjs and form.test.mjs read the gitignored .source/ directory, so the suite fails until node tools/unbundle.mjs has run once."}, {"id": "readme_build_shoot_sequencing", "label": "Build-Immediately-Before-Shoot Sequencing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "npm test re-runs the unbundler, which rewrites public/ files with fresh mtimes; the fail-closed stale-build guard then correctly refuses, so build last before shooting."}, {"id": "readme_fidelity_harness", "label": "Fidelity Harness (shoot / compare / mobile-audit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L121", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_changing_converter_procedure", "label": "Changing the Converter Procedure", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A blind regenerate-and-paste silently deletes hand-added max-lg classes while the 1440 gate still passes; fix tw.mjs, regenerate, diff, re-apply variants, re-run both gates."}, {"id": "readme_max_lg_hand_classes", "label": "166 Hand-written max-lg Responsive Classes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tools/convert.mjs has no concept of a breakpoint, so the mobile pass added variants by hand directly in app/."}, {"id": "readme_five_known_differences", "label": "Five Known-Acceptable Differences at 1440", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four live clock/timer readings plus one occluded Contact background-color; any other difference or total is a real regression."}, {"id": "readme_contact_bg_limitation", "label": "Contact body Background-Color Measurement Limitation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L164", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The check measures only <body>, never the visible [data-ag-root] layer; widening the harness was out of scope, so the gap is documented."}, {"id": "readme_zero_page_overflow_gate", "label": "Zero Page-Level Overflow Gate (390/768)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L184", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "autho